ytdownloader (0.3.8-1) bookworm; urgency=medium

  * Completion verification (file checks + ffprobe) moved into the download
    worker thread. The UI thread is never blocked at the end of a download,
    so the row's progress bar, percentage, pause/resume and X controls stay
    rendered without a gap while the program acknowledges completion.

