ytdownloader (0.3.0-1) bookworm; urgency=medium

  * Single merged Downloads list: running, paused, pending, retrying,
    completed and failed items all visible with progress bars 0-100%.
  * Completed/failed rows greyed out; pause/resume disabled, ✕ still removes.
  * Fix: completed downloads previously vanished (never shown in Finished/
    Completed section) - terminal state now refreshes the list.
  * Fix: long URLs no longer clip the progress bar, ETA and buttons off
    the row (label width no longer drives the row size hint).
  * Pending items can be paused/resumed individually from their rows.

